      "short": "$\\binom{10}{4}=210$ paths.",
      "worked": "Each path has six right movements and four up movements. Choose the positions of the four up movements among the ten movements.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}N&=\\binom{10}{4}\\\\N&=\\frac{10!}{4!6!}\\\\N&=210.\\end{align*}$$\n\nThere are 210 paths.",
